OL,5,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,6,     FThis week Soweto is joined by
OL,7,     FGeoff Dyer, author of the
OL,8,     Facclaimed 'But Beautiful: A Book
OL,9,     FAbout Jazz'. From Monday to
OL,10,     FThursday, he is picking four
OL,11,     Finspirational jazz records for
OL,12,     F4/4.
OL,13,G0030 Through the Night
OL,14,     FThe world premiere of Johannes
OL,15,     FFischer's Festival Overture for
OL,16,     FString Quartet and Electronics
OL,17,     Ffeature alongside Spohr's Concerto
OL,18,     Ffor String Quartet in A minor.
